Initiating search and destroy mission,

178
00:13:09,221 --> 00:13:13,660
Assess the threat, Seeking primary target vulnerability,

179
00:13:13,661 --> 00:13:17,740
target lock acquired, commence firing,

180
00:13:17,741 --> 00:13:21,180
